v1" begin="01:00.420" end="01:03.750"><span begin="01:00.420" end="01:00.780">That's </span><span begin="01:00.780" end="01:01.110">where </span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.320">you'll </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:01.650">find </span><span begin="01:01.650" end="01:03.750">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.840" end="01:08.340"><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:04.500">I'm </span><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.710">the </span><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:06.090">devil's </span><span begin="01:06.090" end="01:08.340">advocate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.640" end="01:13.110"><span begin="01:08.640" end="01:09.060">You </span><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:09.570">don't </span><span begin="01:09.570" end="01:10.560">know </span><span begin="01:10.560" end="01:10.890">the </span><span begin="01:10.890" end="01:11.880">half </span><span begin="01:11.880" end="01:12.240">of </span><span begin="01:12.240" end="01:13.110">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.560" end="01:17.970"><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:13.950">Good </span><span begin="01:13.950" end="01:14.430">luck </span><span begin="01:14.430" end="01:15.750">tryna </span><span begin="01:15.750" end="01:17.130">manage </span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.970">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.180" end="01:22.980"><span begin="01:18.180" end="01:18.600">If </span><span begin="01:18.600" end="01:18.630">a </span><span begin="01:18.630" end="01:18.900">God </span><span begin="01:18.900" end="01:19.020">is </span><span begin="01:19.020" end="01:19.110">a </span><span begin="01:19.110" end="01:19.470">dog</span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:19.470">, </span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:19.560">and </span><span begin="01:19.560" end="01:19.650">a </span><span begin="01:19.650" end="01:20.100">man </span><span begin="01:20.100" end="01:20.250">is </span><span begin="01:20.250" end="01:20.280">a </span><span begin="01:20.280" end="01:20.730">fraud</s